  "coord": "33:8",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "invention",
  "note": "\"merely being seen with his attentions\" garbles and changes the claim.",
  "replacement": "“Well, the reason is — you know how evil-minded the world can be — someone was talking about Alcée Arobin coming to see you. Of course it wouldn’t matter if Mr. Arobin didn’t have such a dreadful reputation. Monsieur Ratignolle was telling me that his attentions alone are considered enough to ruin a woman’s name.”"
 },
